    { "id": "cap-named", "sidPattern": "S-1-15-3-1024-*", "name": "Capability (named)", "origin": "stock", "confidence": "documented", "explain": "A capability SID derived from a capability name (e.g. lpacAppExperience, lpacCom). Windows' app model creates them; Windows grants them on system files so that less-privileged app containers (sandboxed browsers, Store apps) may use exactly those files. The name is shown when it is one of the capability names the app knows." },
